   "hub_id": null,
   "version": "5.0.0",
   "description": "<p>New license is in effect for this release! Please review if these could apply to you.\nThey allow forking and working on the mod but please don’t take my bundles and use them anywhere else without explicit permission!</p>\n<p>Fixed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RM35 mount being invisible from certain angles</li>\n<li>Base profile M4s being incorrectly configured</li>\n<li>Updated Russian locales (Thank you Evgencheg)</li>\n<li>MK8 handguards not appearing correctly</li>\n<li>Elcan 1.5-6 being broken</li>\n<li>TA-01 ACOGs conflicting with Backport and being broken</li>\n<li>AK Plastic upper handguard missing textures</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Improved:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Darkened scope textures</li>\n<li>Loot balancing</li>\n<li>Steiner R1X textures</li>\n<li>Trijicon MRO textures</li>\n<li>Maxim stock textures</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Added:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RAID-XE functioning again</li>\n<li>Eotech 551</li>\n<li>MP5K PDW stock</li>\n<li>MP5 ACR stock</li>\n<li>SP5K handguard</li>\n<li>MP5K prototype handguard</li>\n<li>MP5K upper with 3 lug muzzle</li>\n<li>MP5 Straight waffle magazine</li>\n<li>MP5 Slimline handguard</li>\n<li>Irregular Defense Heschya suppressors (Black, FDE, Grey, and green) and muzzle device</li>\n<li>M3X flashlight (black and tan)</li>\n<li>SAG MK3 Krink chassis (with removable dust cover, Black, Grey, Tan, ODG, plum)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Known issues:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SAG MK3 Krink chassis still needs some coloring work</li>\n<li>By extension, the SAG MK3 AK chassis needs retexturing</li>\n<li>Misc other retexturing projects</li>\n<li>Bipods still need reworked into functional items</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/1263/epics-all-in-one/5.0.0",
